<title>PHILIPPINES: Fil-Estate sets 100 percent dividend.</title>
<headline>Fil-Estate sets 100 percent dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fil-Estate Land Inc said on Tuesday it would pay a 100 percent stock dividend to shareholders.</p>
<p>It set March 6 as the date for its annual stockholders meeting to approve the dividend.</p>
<p>The company did not declare any stock dividends in 1995 and 1996.</p>
</text>
